# MedSync Health, Inc.
## Leave of Absence Policies
**Document ID**: HR-012
**Classification**: Internal
**Effective Date**: January 1, 2025

---

## Overview

MedSync Health provides comprehensive leave benefits to support employees during significant life events, health needs, and civic responsibilities. This document outlines all leave types and processes.

---

## Paid Time Off (PTO)

### Unlimited PTO Policy

MedSync offers unlimited PTO with minimum encouraged usage:

| Tenure | Minimum Encouraged | Manager Approval |
|--------|-------------------|------------------|
| All employees | 15 days/year | <5 consecutive days: Self-service |
| All employees | — | 5-10 days: Manager approval |
| All employees | — | >10 days: Manager + Skip-level |

### PTO Guidelines

**Encouraged Use**:
- Take time off when you need it
- Minimum of 15 days per year
- No "saving" days—this isn't accrued PTO
- Disconnect fully during time off

**Process**:
1. Request in Workday at least 2 weeks in advance
2. Coordinate with team for coverage
3. Set out-of-office message
4. Update Slack status

**Blackout Periods**:
- End of quarter (last 2 weeks) for Sales
- End of month for Finance (close period)
- Launch windows for Product/Engineering

