## Parental Leave

### Birth/Adoption Leave

| Parent Type | Paid Leave | Eligibility |
|-------------|------------|-------------|
| Birth parent | 16 weeks | All employees |
| Non-birth parent | 16 weeks | All employees |
| Adoptive parent | 16 weeks | All employees |
| Foster placement | 8 weeks | All employees |

### Parental Leave Details

**Timing**:
- Leave can begin up to 2 weeks before due date
- Must be taken within 12 months of birth/placement
- Can be taken in one block or two blocks (minimum 4 weeks each)

**Benefits During Leave**:
- Full salary continuation
- All benefits continue
- Equity continues to vest
- No impact on bonus eligibility

**Return to Work**:
- Same or comparable position guaranteed
- Flexible return options available (phased return)
- Lactation rooms available at all offices
- Backup childcare benefit available

### Parental Leave Process

1. Notify manager and HR 30+ days in advance
2. Complete leave request in Workday
3. Meet with HR to discuss logistics
4. Create coverage plan with manager
5. Submit short-term disability forms (birth parents)
6. Return-to-work planning meeting 2 weeks before return

