## Sabbatical Leave

### Eligibility

| Tenure | Sabbatical Entitlement |
|--------|----------------------|
| 5 years | 4 weeks paid |
| 10 years | 6 weeks paid |

### Sabbatical Guidelines

- Must be taken in one continuous block
- Cannot be combined with other leave (except PTO buffer)
- 6-month advance notice required
- Coverage plan required
- Post-sabbatical commitment: 12 months

