## Personal Leave of Absence

### Unpaid Personal Leave

| Duration | Approval Required |
|----------|------------------|
| Up to 2 weeks | Manager + HR |
| 2-4 weeks | VP + HR |
| 4-12 weeks | SVP + HR |
