## Leave Administration

### How to Request Leave

| Leave Type | Request Via | Notice Required |
|------------|-------------|-----------------|
| PTO | Workday | 2+ weeks |
| Parental | HR + Workday | 30+ days |
| Medical | HR | ASAP |
| Bereavement | HR + Manager | ASAP |
| Jury Duty | HR + Manager | ASAP |
| Military | HR | ASAP |
| Sabbatical | HR + VP | 6 months |
| Personal LOA | HR + Manager | 30+ days |
| Volunteer | Manager | 1 week |

### Leave Impact on Benefits

| Leave Type | Benefits | Equity | Bonus |
|------------|----------|--------|-------|
| PTO | Continue | Vests | Eligible |
| Parental | Continue | Vests | Eligible |
| Medical (STD) | Continue | Vests | Prorated |
| Medical (LTD) | Continue | Paused | Ineligible |
| Bereavement | Continue | Vests | Eligible |
| Military | Continue | Vests | Eligible |
| Unpaid LOA | Employee-paid | Paused | Prorated |

### Return from Leave

1. Notify HR of expected return date
2. Provide any required documentation
3. Complete return-to-work checklist
4. Meet with manager for transition
5. Gradual ramp-up if needed

